t, comp_dates[-n:]) cat CUNG mot lat voi gia + caller luon xin kem ngay.", "vi_sao_caller_LUON_xin_ngay": "ngay lay tu DUNG cac bar da dung lam gia nen KHONG them loi goi API nao, va nhanh mean-N bo qua tham so nay (khoa bang test A2). Xin co dieu kien thi dung ngay lat state se ra fail-safe cam — dung cai bay 'doi cau hinh ma khong co gi doi'.", "selfcheck": {"moi": "discretionary_rule_a_selfcheck.py 37/37 PASS (A tuong thich nguoc / B cong thuc + doi xung / C bat bien #4 / D 7 duong hong deu fail-safe / E provenance vong tron khep kin voi load_plan / F ghep cong viec 1 / G bat bien state)", "TZ": "PASS ca 3 moi truong: env -u TZ, America/New_York, Pacific/Kiritimati (§16/§19)", "mo_rong": "dynamic_no_chase_ceiling_selfcheck.py +G18 (7 ca): with_dates=True tra ngay SONG SONG tung phan tu voi gia, fail-safe van tra MOT None (khong phai (None,None) lam no unpack)", "scope_§23": "23/23 PASS — hop scope map cua discretionary_accumulation.py + no_chase_ceiling.py + executor.py (do bang selfcheck_scope_map.sh, khong doan)", "E2E": "e2e_inject_rule_a.py — chay process_account() THAT, offline hoan toan (broker/NAV/fill stub, plan+state trong thu muc tam). Chuoi inject->engine->lenh ra tran 20.703 + provenance neo 08-14; chan doi chung mean-5 ra 20.744 = DUNG tran plan LIVE 08-17 that. Day la bai test duy nhat bat duoc lo hong wiring o tren — test don vi tung mat xich deu xanh trong khi 3 dong NOI chung thi hong.", "§5b": "MIKE_BOT_TEST_MODE=1 dat vo dieu kien o dau selfcheck moi, truoc moi import co the dung Executor"}, "mot_test_da_PASS_SAI_LY_DO": "F2/F3 ban dau PASS nhung vi SAI ly do: check_ref_vs_live/rule_a_in_force doc bang getattr (nhan PlannedOrder, khong phai dict tho), truyen dict vao thi moi ca deu ra 'thieu ceiling_anchor_price' => 'CHAN' dung ky vong nhung khong phai vi co che dinh test. F1 la ca duy nhat phan biet duoc => no FAIL va lo ra. Da sua test dung shim attribute + ghi chu ly do ngay tai cho. KHONG phai bug [REDACTED].", "chua_lam_dung_chi_dao": "KHO