vao phien DA DONG, tai lap 1 lan/ngay luc lap plan"], "hong_bat_ky_dau": "VUT con so plan khai, quay ve luat cu (tran = entry_anchor_price). Khong ton tai duong FAIL-OPEN: ca Rule A hong + khong co entry_anchor_price cung tra None chu khong giu lai so da khai.", "pham_vi_do_that_khong_doan": {"phuong_phap": "quet 97 file plan lich su trong data/trade_plans/", "entry_anchor_price": "CHI xuat hien o book LAG (DRI/POW/SCL/SSI, plan 08-10, ca 2 account) — dung ca DollarBill 08-09 phai tu che workaround", "BAL_CAPIT_momentum": "0 hit — khong bao gio lot vao pham vi", "DISCRETIONARY_SPECIAL": "loai TUONG MINH. Book do DA CO engine tran rieng (discretionary_accumulation.resolve_price_band, LIVE cho TV1 ca 2 account) va dynamic_ceiling.sessions = 5 cua no CHINH LA Rule B. => Rule A o book do = doi sessions 5 -> 1 trong state file, la thay doi CAU HINH can user duyet, KHONG phai them co che thu hai len cung mot lenh."}, "chenh_lech_that_do_bang_BQ_tren_ca_08_10": {"DRI": "13.000 -> 13.596 (+4,6%)", "POW": "13.400 -> 14.008", "SCL": "24.200 -> 24.926", "SSI": "24.450 -> 25.183", "anchor_dung": "phien [REDACTED] (T6 lien truoc plan_date T2 08-10)"}, "selfcheck": {"file_moi": "rule_a_ceiling_selfcheck.py — 8 nhom A..H, PASS", "hoi_quy_nothing_changed": "nap lai 96 plan LIVE THAT, 23 lenh mua co tran, 0 lenh doi gia tri", "ca_chung_minh_nguoc": "gia SAN 13.500 > tran cu 13.000 => executor._limit_price tra None (KHONG dat duoc lenh). Cung quote do, Rule A dat duoc.", "TZ": "PASS ca 3 moi truong: env -u TZ, America/New_York, Pacific/Kiritimati (§16/§19)", "quet_rong_plan_py": "29/29 selfcheck phu thuoc trading_bot/plan.py PASS (scope map do bang may, khong chep tay)"}, "hai_diem_can_nguoi_doc_biet": ["GAP TU PHAT HIEN + DA VA trong chinh job nay: cong tuoi anchor ban dau chi so 'phien cuoi cua ma' voi 'phien cuoi cua thi truong' — khi BQ CHUA nap toi plan_date thi moc thi truong TU NO da cu, moi ma deu khop, cong mu hoan toan. Da them cong tuoi tuyet doi theo NGAY LICH (mac dinh 4