yen). TV1/DRI/SCL deu dang trong so => dung sai <=1% se chan oan sach UPCOM, con >3,4% thi to hon ca tau=3% nen vo dung."}, "dung_sai_1pct_can_cu": {"can_duoi": "nhieu cheo-feed BQ ticker.Price vs DNSE ohlc: 28/29 ma khop TOI TUNG DONG cung ngay 08-14; ca con lai SSI lech -20% = feed hong that (dung thu phai bat). Nhieu cau truc con lai chi la do phan giai 10d cua payload ohlc: <=0,10% o ma 10.000d", "can_tren": "phai << tau=3%; cung duoi max_chase_pct_buy=1,5% va chase_cap_vol_ceil=4% => sai so lot cong khong bao gio an het tran duoi tinh. 1% = 1/3 ngan sach tau", "gioi_han_da_cong_bo": "plan tre 1 phien ma ma di <1% qua dem se LOT — nhung khi ay sai so tran cung <1%. Chan sai so LON, khong hua bat moi plan cu (khoa bang test B7)"}, "fail_closed": "thieu gia song / ohlc loi / anchor rac => CHAN. Ngoai le DUY NHAT: broker khong co client ohlc (Sim/PHS/paper) => bo qua cong (chan paper khong dung tien that)", "verify": {"selfcheck_moi": "rule_a_ref_guard_selfcheck.py 8 nhom A-H, 48/48 PASS", "TZ": "PASS ca 3 moi truong: env -u TZ, America/New_York, Pacific/Kiritimati (§16/§19)", "scope_§23": "18/18 selfcheck phu thuoc trading_bot/executor.py PASS (selfcheck_scope_map.sh do bang may)", "hoi_quy_plan_that": "nap lai 68 plan LIVE that, 312 lenh mua — 0 lenh khai Rule A, 0 lenh NGOAI Rule A bi cong dong toi => hanh vi LIVE hom nay KHONG doi"}, "de_xuat_rieng_CHUA_LAM": {"a_QUAN_TRONG": "Tran duoi % va tran Rule A la HAI rang buoc CHONG NHAU va cai nao bind phu thuoc rvol_20d. Voi ref_price == anchor (dung hinh dang LAG hom nay: DRI/POW/SCL/SSI plan 08-10 deu co ref_price == entry_anchor_price TUYET DOI): cap_chase = anchor x (1+clamp(2 x rvol_20d, 1,5%, 4%)) vs tran_A = anchor x 1,03 => Rule A CHI THAT SU bind khi chase_pct >= 3%, tuc rvol_20d >= 1,5%/phien. Duoi muc do, tran duoi 1,5% moi la rang buoc quyet dinh va tau=3% user duyet KHONG BAO GIO voi toi duoc — ke ca khi anchor hoan toan dung. (Do tren may nay: DRI chase = 3,33% => bind; nhung do la thuoc tinh rvol tung